			annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

		partition Núcleos = calculated
			mode: import
			source = ```
					
					    DISTINCT( FILTER( UNION(
					        VALUES( LY[Cod_Nucleo] ),
					        VALUES( R0002[Cod_Nucleo] ),
					        VALUES( NucleoOport[go_st_codigo] )
					    ), NOT(ISBLANK(LY[Cod_Nucleo]))))
					```

